'''''Plagiothecium''''' is a genus of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Plagiotheciaceae]]. It has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Plagiothecium Bruch & Schimp. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2679600 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=12 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

